OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1785334695
OL,3,CShop owner found with #18,000 worth of
OL,4,Cillegal vapes avoids jail
OL,6,FThe owner of an Eastbourne shop where
OL,7,Fmore than #18,000 worth of illegal
OL,8,Fvapes were discovered has avoided jail.
OL,10,FTrading Standards officers inspected
OL,11,FZap Off Licence Limited in Seaside
OL,12,FRoad in April 2024.
OL,14,FThey uncovered 33 vapes in a plastic
OL,15,Fbag on the shop counter and a further
OL,16,F1,833 in a basement area of the shop.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
