FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1785334695
OL,3,CShop owner found with #18,000 worth of
OL,4,Cillegal vapes avoids jail
OL,6,FHamza Pirot, the licence holder, was
OL,7,Ffound guilty of possessing 1,866
OL,8,Fillegal vapes and sentenced to 21
OL,9,Fmonths in prison suspended for 24
OL,10,Fmonths.
OL,12,FThe 52-year-old was also ordered to
OL,13,Fcarry out 75 hours of unpaid work over
OL,14,Fthe next 12 months when he appeared at
OL,15,FBrighton Crown Court for sentencing on
OL,16,FMonday, July 6.
OL,18,FPirot had previously been warned about
OL,19,Fthe possession of illegal, over
OL,20,Fcapacity vapes by East Sussex Trading
OL,21,FStandards officers in 2022 and 2023.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1785334695
OL,3,CShop owner found with #18,000 worth of
OL,4,Cillegal vapes avoids jail
OL,6,FWhen formally interviewed, Pirot
OL,7,Fblamed the discovery of the illegal
OL,8,Fitems found by the sale counter on a
OL,9,Fformer employee who had taken them
OL,10,Fupstairs from the basement by mistake.
OL,12,FBut he was found guilty after a short
OL,13,Ftrial.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
