OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1785334695
OL,3,CShop owner found with #18,000 worth of
OL,4,Cillegal vapes avoids jail
OL,6,FCllr Pete Morley, East Sussex County
OL,7,FCouncil lead member with
OL,8,Fresponsibility for Trading Standards,
OL,9,Fsaid: "As well as undermining
OL,10,Fbusinesses who trade within the law,
OL,11,Fthe sale of illegal vapes, which avoid
OL,12,Fvital safety checks and are linked to
OL,13,Forganised crime, puts our residents at
OL,14,Frisk.
OL,16,F"Having warned Mr Pirot on previous
OL,17,Foccasions, our Trading Standards
OL,18,Fofficers remained vigilant and have
OL,19,Fbeen able to keep a significant number
OL,20,Fof illegal vapes off the streets.
OL,26,@qD@GOUxD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/5
