CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1785334695
OL,3,CShop owner found with #18,000 worth of
OL,4,Cillegal vapes avoids jail
OL,6,F"We take the sale of illegal tobacco
OL,7,Fand vaping products extremely
OL,8,Fseriously and this case shows that we
OL,9,Fwill do everything in our power to
OL,10,Ftake action against anyone putting our
OL,11,Fresidents at risk."
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@SO]
